# Mobile layout QA gate

When editing layout CSS, event cards, headers, or forms:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/mobile-page-qa/SKILL.md`.
2. Run `python tools/audit_mobile_pages.py` before considering the task done.
3. Prefer Playwright (`--playwright`) when the user reported a live mobile bug.
4. Keep brochure and `/app/` chrome consistent (same ubar / masthead / footer pattern).
